{
  "slug": "ultraship",
  "name": "Ultraship",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "All-in-one builder toolkit for Claude Code. 22 automatic skills, 20 tools, 5 agents. Covers the full dev lifecycle — brainstorming, planning, TDD, code review, frontend design, SEO/GEO/AEO audits, Lighthouse performance, security hardening, and deployment. Skills activate automatically based on context. Run /ship to get a full ship-readiness scorecard.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **45 skills**, **13 agents**, **16 commands**, **3 hooks** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (45): `a11y` (Accessibility audit + auto-fix (WCAG 2.2 A/AA)), `architecture` (Living Architecture Map — auto-generate Mermaid diagrams of your codebase), `brainstorming` (You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior), `canary` (Post-deploy canary monitoring — checks site health, detects regressions, monitors for errors after deployment), `clone-patterns` (Learn From the Best — analyze patterns from any codebase and apply them to yours), `code-review` (Code review with principal-engineer-level depth), `compete` (Competitive X-Ray — analyze any competitor URL vs your site), `cost` (AI Build Cost Tracker — track how much AI is costing you per feature), and 37 more\n- **Agents** (13): `a11y-auditor` (Runs the static accessibility (WCAG 2.2) audit using the a11y-scanner tool), `browser-verifier` (Uses Playwright MCP to smoke-test the running application in a browser), `canary-monitor` (Runs post-deploy canary monitoring — health checks, regression detection, error pattern scanning), `code-reviewer` (Use this agent when a major project step has been completed and needs to be reviewed against the…), `compete-analyzer` (Runs competitive X-ray analysis comparing two sites), `growth-tracker` (Runs post-ship growth intelligence check), `incident-responder` (Runs production incident diagnostics), `launch-auditor` (Runs launch readiness audit on a project), and 5 more\n- **Commands** (16): `brainstorm` (Deprecated - use the ultraship:brainstorming skill instead), `bundle` (Track bundle size, detect heavy dependencies, compare to previous builds), `codex` (Generate a compact codebase index to save tokens), `content` (Content quality analysis (readability, keyword density, GEO scoring)), `deps` (Detect unused and outdated dependencies), `execute-plan` (Deprecated - use the ultraship:executing-plans skill instead), `health` (Health check a production URL (status, response time, SSL, security headers)), `perf` (Run Lighthouse performance audit with auto-fix), and 8 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostCompact`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `context7`, `playwright`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ultraship@claude-community` from `Houseofmvps/ultraship`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 45,
    "agent": 13,
    "hook": 3,
    "command": 16,
    "mcp": 2
